---
/**
 * SEO-U30: /ffl-payment-processing (new). Copy is Brandy's FINAL (handoff/SEO-U30/FINAL.md).
 * Slots filled from Paul's 10/21 answers (PAUL-0901). GOAT Payments and Payroc may be named on this page.
 * No payments brand name, no fee figures, no approval promises, no timelines.
 */
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import EcommerceCluster from "../components/EcommerceCluster.astro";
import FaqBlock from "../components/FaqBlock.astro";
import TalkSection from "../components/TalkSection.astro";
import { LINKS, btnPlan, linkClass } from "../lib/links";
import { withBase } from "../lib/base";
import { TRUSTINDEX_REVIEWS_HREF } from "../lib/google-reviews";
import { FAQ_PAYMENTS } from "../lib/faq";
import { md } from "../lib/md";

// CA-VOICE-P1 batch 4 (Paul yes via Chief, 2026-11-10 12:49 PM ET): copy from batch-4/ffl-payment-processing.md, shipped as drafted.
// Chief ruling (c): the locked Contact heading is on the plate; "Tell us how you take payments today" stays the button label up top.

const ext = { target: "_blank", rel: "noopener noreferrer" };
const h2 = "text-xl font-semibold text-white";
const para = "mt-4 max-w-3xl text-sm leading-relaxed text-zinc-400";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="FFL Payment Processing for Gun Store Websites | Coriolis"
  description="Take cards and other payments on your FFL website. Coriolis works with GOAT Payments and Payroc and installs the gateway at setup."
  path="/ffl-payment-processing"
  faq={FAQ_PAYMENTS}
  extraJsonLd={[
    {
      "@type": "Service",
      name: "FFL payment gateway setup",
      serviceType: "Payment gateway installation for FFL ecommerce",
      provider: { "@id": `${LINKS.home}/#organization` },
      areaServed: { "@type": "Country", name: "United States" },
    },
  ]}
>
  <section class="border-b border-zinc-800/80 py-12 sm:py-16">
    <div class="mx-auto w-full max-w-7xl px-4 sm:px-6">
      <p class="text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-gold">Ecommerce · Payments</p>
      <h1 class="mt-3 max-w-4xl text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-white sm:text-5xl leading-[1.12]">
        FFL payment processing for your gun store website
      </h1>
      <p class="mt-5 max-w-3xl text-base leading-relaxed text-zinc-300" set:html={md("FFL payment processing is how a licensed dealer takes cards for guns and ammo online: a merchant account that allows firearm sales, connected to the website through a payment gateway. Many mainstream processors don't allow firearm sales. Coriolis works with GOAT Payments and Payroc, and installs and tests the payment gateway as part of setup, on Basic Setup ($500) or Retail Setup ($2,500). The merchant account stays in your store's legal name, and its fees are yours.")} />
      <div class="mt-8">
        <a href="#talk" class={btnPlan}>Tell us how you take payments today</a>
      </div>
      <EcommerceCluster current="ffl-payment-processing" dropshipLabel="listing distributor catalogs on a store you own" />
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="border-b border-zinc-800/80 py-12" id="turned-down">
    <div class="mx-auto w-full max-w-7xl px-4 sm:px-6">
      <h2 class={h2}>{"Why gun stores get turned down, and what dealers use instead"}</h2>
      <p class={para} set:html={md("Many mainstream processors and store payment add-ons list firearms and ammunition as prohibited, and across the card industry, firearms are generally treated as a high-risk category.")} />
      <p class={para} set:html={md("What dealers use instead is a merchant account underwritten for firearms by a bank or processor that accepts FFLs. It connects to your store through a payment gateway: the gateway moves the card data, and the merchant account is the part that gets approved for your business.")} />
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="border-b border-zinc-800/80 py-12" id="setup">
    <div class="mx-auto w-full max-w-7xl px-4 sm:px-6">
      <h2 class={h2}>{"What Coriolis sets up at launch, including the two test charges"}</h2>
      <p class={para} set:html={md("Coriolis works with GOAT Payments and Payroc, so we can provide the gateway, help you set it up, and set up other payment options during setup. Gateway installation is part of Basic Setup ($500) and Retail Setup ($2,500). If you already have a gateway approved for firearms, you can bring your own, and Coriolis puts it on checkout.")} />
      <p class={para} set:html={md("Once your merchant account is approved, Coriolis enables the gateway, runs a small live authorization and voids it. Then you place a test order for a non-firearm product with a real card, and the second test, with a firearm in the cart, comes only after ship-to-FFL is on.")} />
      <p class={para} set:html={md("Checkout runs one card plugin, because two gateways side by side drop orders.")} />
      <p class={para} set:html={md("You can take cards through your merchant account and the gateway on your checkout, and it isn't cards-only, so tell us what you want to take when we talk.")} />
      <p class={para} set:html={md("Make sure the account is approved for what you sell (firearms, ammunition or both), and get that approval in writing before you launch. No one can promise approval, because the processor decides.")} />
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-12" id="ffl-checkout">
    <div class="mx-auto w-full max-w-7xl px-4 sm:px-6">
      <h2 class={h2}>{"How the gateway and FFL Checkout split the work at checkout"}</h2>
      <p class={para} set:html={md("The gateway charges the card. It doesn't check a 4473, run a background check or pick the receiving dealer; those are checkout and transfer steps. FFL Checkout adds the dealer selector, and Coriolis includes it on Militia ($269 a month) and above. A gun bought online from out of state ships to a licensed dealer in the buyer's home state, and this is not legal advice.")} />
      <p class={para} set:html={md("If you sell only online, you get the same payment setup. Coriolis builds WooCommerce on your domain and installs the payment gateway at setup. Militia ($269 a month) adds 21 distributor catalogs for dropshipping, and firearm orders ship to a receiving FFL.")} />
      <p class={para} set:html={md("See [the setup and monthly plan prices](/ffl-website-cost), the [FFL website plans](/ecommerce), or [whether self-hosted WooCommerce can sell firearms](/can-you-use-woocommerce-to-sell-guns).")} />
      <p class="mt-8 text-sm text-zinc-400" set:html={md("Coriolis has 100+ clients and a [5-star Google rating](https://www.trustindex.io/reviews/coriolisagency.com), and is a member of NSSF, FPC and GOA.")} />
    </div>
  </section>

  <FaqBlock items={FAQ_PAYMENTS} heading={"The questions dealers ask about taking cards for guns and ammo online"} />

  <TalkSection
    pillar="Ecommerce"
    heading={"Tell us about the website you want and we'll make it happen."}
    subline={"We build, host, and support your open source WooCommerce website. There is no contract and you can cancel at any time."}
  />
</BaseLayout>
